    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a B2B lead qualification specialist.\n\nAnalyze the business using ONLY the information provided below.\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- Do NOT invent facts.\n- Do NOT assume the business has a specific problem unless the supplied data supports it.\n- Do NOT claim that the business is losing customers, missing leads, missing appointments, etc. unless there is evidence.\n- Do NOT invent services offered by the business.\n- If there is not enough evidence for a specific opportunity, say \"Insufficient evidence\".\n- Recommend an AI automation service only when there is a reasonable connection to the available information.\n\nLEAD SCORING RULES:\n\nYou MUST assign a lead_score from 0 to 100.\n\nCalculate the score using these factors:\n\n1. Business is a relevant B2B prospect: 0–20 points\n2. Business has a clear potential fit for AI/automation services: 0–25 points\n3. Business has an active website or online presence: 0–15 points\n4. Business appears established based on rating and review count: 0–15 points\n5. There is a reasonable business improvement/opportunity that can be addressed by automation: 0–15 points\n6. There is enough information to personalize an outreach message: 0–10 points\n\nAdd the points to produce the final score.\n\nDo NOT automatically give a score of 0 just because a specific pain point cannot be proven.\n\nIf a pain point cannot be verified, write \"Insufficient evidence\" for the pain_point field, but still score the lead based on the other available evidence.\n\nThe score must be an integer between 0 and 100.\n\nA business with strong evidence across multiple factors should normally receive a score above 70.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nBusiness Name: {{ $json['Business name'] }}\nCategory: {{ $json.Catogery }}\nRating: {{ $json.Rating }}\nReviews: {{ $json.Reviews }}\nAddress: {{ $json.Address }}\nWebsite: {{ $json.Website }}\n\nReturn exactly:\n\n{\n  \"lead_score\": 0,\n  \"business_type\": \"\",\n  \"recommended_service\": \"\",\n  \"pain_point\": \"\",\n  \"evidence\": \"\",\n  \"personalization_angle\": \"\"\n}\n\nDo not use markdown.\nDo not use ```json.\nDo not write anything before or after the JSON.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a B2B lead qualification specialist. Use only supplied facts. Never invent details. Return ONLY valid JSON matching the schema."
        }
      },
