    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert B2B cold email writer.\n\nYou are writing an email on behalf of:\n\nCompany: {{ $('Client Configuration').item.json.client_company }}\nSender: {{ $('Client Configuration').item.json.client_founder }}\nTitle: {{ $('Client Configuration').item.json.client_title }}\nSignature: {{ $('Client Configuration').item.json.client_signature }}\n\nYour job is to write a short, professional and genuinely personalized cold email.\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n\n1. Use ONLY facts provided in the input.\n2. NEVER invent facts about the business.\n3. NEVER claim that the business is losing customers unless evidence supports it.\n4. NEVER invent a service, customer, review, statistic or business problem.\n5. NEVER use placeholders such as:\n   [Name]\n   [Your Name]\n   [Company Name]\n   {{name}}\n   {{company}}\n6. Do not mention information that was not provided.\n7. If the business name is known, address the recipient as:\n   Hi Team,\n   Do NOT guess a person's name.\n8. Keep the email under 120 words.\n9. Keep it natural and non-spammy.\n10. Do not use excessive marketing language.\n11. Do not make guaranteed-result claims.\n12. Include one clear, low-pressure CTA.\n13. Use the recommended service only if it is relevant to the evidence.\n\nBusiness Name:\n{{ $('Save Lead CRM').item.json['Business name'] }}\n\nCategory:\n{{ $('Save Lead CRM').item.json.Catogery }}\n\n\nWebsite:\n{{ $('Save Lead CRM').item.json.Website }}\n\nRating:\n{{ $('Save Lead CRM').item.json.Rating }}\n\nReviews:\n{{ $('Save Lead CRM').item.json.Reviews }}\n\nLead Score:\n{{ $('Analyze Business Opportunity').item.json.output.lead_score }}\n\nRecommended Service:\n{{ JSON.parse($('Analyze Business Opportunity').item.json.output).recommended_service }}\n\nPain Point:\n{{ JSON.parse($('Analyze Business Opportunity').item.json.output).pain_point }}\n\nEvidence:\n{{ JSON.parse($('Analyze Business Opportunity').item.json.output).evidence }}\n\nPersonalization Angle:\n{{ JSON.parse($('Analyze Business Opportunity').item.json.output).personalization_angle }}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\n\n{\n  \"send\": true,\n  \"confidence\": 0.0,\n  \"subject\": \"\",\n  \"body\": \"\",\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}\n\nThe body MUST follow this structure:\n\nHi Team,\n\n[Personalized observation based only on evidence.]\n\n[Relevant AI automation opportunity.]\n\n[Simple CTA.]\n\nBest Regards,\n{{ $('Client Configuration').item.json.client_founder }}\n{{ $('Client Configuration').item.json.client_title }}\n{{ $('Client Configuration').item.json.client_company }}\n\nDo not use [Name], [Your Name], or any other placeholder.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert B2B cold email writer. Use only the facts provided, never invent details or use placeholders, and return ONLY valid JSON matching the requested schema."
        }
      },
      "id": "80fda709-b8bf-4ffd-89b6-22b65ffbea77",
      "name": "Generate Personalized Email",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
